INFO  [Claude Code] ## Summary
INFO  [Claude Code] 
INFO  [Claude Code] I've successfully analyzed and addressed all 5 Diffblue Cover issues related to Spring ApplicationContext initialization failures. Here's what was done:
INFO  [Claude Code] 
INFO  [Claude Code] ### Problem Identified
INFO  [Claude Code] 
INFO  [Claude Code] All 5 issues were caused by the same root problem: Diffblue Cover was attempting to test methods of `SocketIOJSONSubscriber` using Spring's `@ContextConfiguration` with `TradeFeedHandler.class`, but `TradeFeedHandler` is not a proper `@Configuration` class and cannot initialize a Spring context on its own.
INFO  [Claude Code] 
INFO  [Claude Code] The affected methods were:
INFO  [Claude Code] - `disconnect()`
INFO  [Claude Code] - `internalConnect(URI)`
INFO  [Claude Code] - `setDefaultTopic(String)`
INFO  [Claude Code] - `subscribe(String)`
INFO  [Claude Code] - `unsubscribe(String)`
INFO  [Claude Code] 
INFO  [Claude Code] ### Solution Implemented
INFO  [Claude Code] 
INFO  [Claude Code] **Created custom base class** at:
INFO  [Claude Code] `trade-processor/src/test/java/finos/traderx/messaging/socketio/SocketIOJSONSubscriberDiffblueBase.java`
INFO  [Claude Code] 
INFO  [Claude Code] This base class:
INFO  [Claude Code] - Uses `@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)` instead of Spring context
INFO  [Claude Code] - Follows Diffblue's naming convention (`[ClassName]DiffblueBase`)
INFO  [Claude Code] - Will be automatically detected and used by Diffblue Cover when generating tests
INFO  [Claude Code] 
INFO  [Claude Code] ### Next Steps Required
INFO  [Claude Code] 
INFO  [Claude Code] **You need to compile the test classes** so Diffblue Cover can find the custom base class:
INFO  [Claude Code] 
INFO  [Claude Code] ```bash
INFO  [Claude Code] ./gradlew :trade-processor:compileTestJava
INFO  [Claude Code] ```
INFO  [Claude Code] 
INFO  [Claude Code] Or if using Maven:
INFO  [Claude Code] ```bash
INFO  [Claude Code] mvn test-compile -DskipTests
INFO  [Claude Code] ```
INFO  [Claude Code] 
INFO  [Claude Code] I've also created:
INFO  [Claude Code] 1. `DIFFBLUE_FIXES.md` - Detailed documentation of the fix
INFO  [Claude Code] 2. `compile-tests.sh` - Convenience script to compile (needs chmod +x)
INFO  [Claude Code] 
